  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustaining Peace during Elections Processes (SELECT) project.   The overall objective of the &#x201c;Sustaining Peace during Electoral Process&#x201d; (SELECT) project is to build the capacity of both national electoral stakeholders and international partners to: a) identify risks factors that may affect elections; b) design programmes and activities specifically aimed at preventing and reducing the risk of violence; c) implement operations related to the electoral processes in a conflict sensitive manner.</narrative>
  </description>
